{"is_error":false,"duration_api_ms":64630,"num_turns":3,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"337d4078-e492-4e7b-a2c8-a423fc6d4096","total_cost_usd":0.195653,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1994,"cache_read_input_tokens":78918,"output_tokens":5053,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1994,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":4873,"cache_read_input_tokens":39459,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1994,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1994},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":9804,"outputTokens":21,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.009909,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-4-5","provider":"firstParty"},"claude-opus-5":{"inputTokens":4,"outputTokens":5053,"cacheReadInputTokens":78918,"cacheCreationInputTokens":1994,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.185744,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5","provider":"firstParty"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"{\n  \"agent\": \"debris-flavourist\",\n  \"pieces\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"torn_foil_blanket\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Chipped Hull Slab\",\n      \"flavour\": \"A six-sided grey slab with fracture lines crawling right across its face and a notch bitten out of the top edge. Lightest thing on the low shelf, and it still wants to come apart in the tether.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"light\", \"low\", \"fragile\", \"small\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"crumpled_panel_stack\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Scorched Layer Stack\",\n      \"flavour\": \"Quilted beige sheeting over white, rust and blue under-layers, with a ragged burn hole punched clean through the top face. Cheap floor scrap, sold by the armful.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"light\", \"low\", \"cheap\", \"small\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"cracked_solar_array\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Split Cell Panel Shards\",\n      \"flavour\": \"Two angular gridded blue fragments, tilted apart where one panel let go. The pale edges are glass-sharp and the grid will keep on splitting if you jostle it.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"light\", \"low\", \"fragile\", \"medium\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"bent_truss_section\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Tangled Rod Mat\",\n      \"flavour\": \"A dozen thin rusty bars crossed at every angle in a flat mat, speckled brown where the coating gave up. Bottom-shelf steel that pays about what steel pays.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"low\", \"cheap\", \"medium\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"spent_kick_motor_casing\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Spent Kick Motor Casing\",\n      \"flavour\": \"An hourglass of grey metal, flared at both ends with a sooty throat pinched in the middle. Compact, solid, and heavier in the hand than it looks from the cockpit.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"low\", \"solid\", \"small\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"collapsed_dish_frame\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Collapsed Dish Frame\",\n      \"flavour\": \"A shallow grey dish still bolted to its stump of a base, feed arm reaching over the centre, rim dented and split down one side. Bulky enough to fight you all the way to the hold.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"low\", \"solid\", \"oversized\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"shredded_antenna_mesh\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Snapped Antenna Boom\",\n      \"flavour\": \"One long shaft carrying ten short crossbars, half of them kinked or broken off short, with a blue-grey lump fused near the low end. The rest snap if you swing it.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"low\", \"fragile\", \"medium\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"cracked_battery_pallet\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Yellow-Framed Cell Box\",\n      \"flavour\": \"A dark slab of a unit wrapped in a fat yellow crash frame, tipped on its side, one small inset port winking pale at the corner. Whole, and it survived whatever put it here.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"low\", \"solid\", \"medium\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"seized_reaction_wheel_housing\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Seized Reaction Wheel\",\n      \"flavour\": \"Eight spokes from a stubby hub out to a wide flat rim, one notch chewed out of the low edge. It does not turn any more and it does not care that you tried.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"low\", \"solid\", \"small\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"burst_pressurant_sphere\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Pitted Slag Cluster\",\n      \"flavour\": \"Three or four black angular chunks jammed together, faces pitted, chipped edges going pale where something struck them. No seams, no fittings, nothing manufactured left in it.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"low\", \"solid\", \"small\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"delaminated_radiator_fin\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Bolted Bracket Plate\",\n      \"flavour\": \"A stepped grey plate with six bolt holes near the corners and two scratches scored across the middle. Thin enough that a rough grab is what finally folds it.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"low\", \"fragile\", \"medium\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"torn_solar_wing_spar\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Paired Solar Wings\",\n      \"flavour\": \"Two tall wings side by side, ruled into dark blue cells with pale dividers, the right one sitting a few degrees out of true with its neighbour. Flat, awkward, and it catches on everything.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"solid\", \"medium\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"cracked_optics_barrel\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Ringed Optics Barrel\",\n      \"flavour\": \"A short ribbed cylinder on its side, front element dark and holding one bright cyan glint, with a spare ring section parked behind it. That glint goes the first time you knock it.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"fragile\", \"small\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"fractured_docking_collar\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Fractured Docking Collar\",\n      \"flavour\": \"A heavy hollow ring, thicker on one side, with a bite broken out of the upper rim and three specks of itself still drifting alongside. Whatever it held on to, it let go.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"solid\", \"medium\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"dead_thruster_quad\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Dead Thruster Housing\",\n      \"flavour\": \"A corrugated drum of pale ridged discs bolted to a tan block, with one brown feed line looping over the top and back down. Dry as a bone since the cascade.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"solid\", \"small\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"buckled_pressure_bulkhead\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Buckled Bulkhead Sheet\",\n      \"flavour\": \"A ragged-edged grey plate with a deep crease folded through it, shedding chips off one side as it turns. Oversized, unwieldy, and it costs you most of a trip on its own.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"heavy\", \"oversized\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"ruptured_helium_tank\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Strapped Insulation Roll\",\n      \"flavour\": \"Quilted blue soft goods rolled long and cinched at the waist with tan strapping, ends still puffed out. Intact, which around here counts as a small miracle.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"solid\", \"medium\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"shattered_star_tracker\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Shattered Star Tracker\",\n      \"flavour\": \"A bevelled frame holding pale blue glass, cracks radiating out from a black star-shaped hole punched dead centre. One more knock and you are hauling a frame full of grit.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"fragile\", \"small\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"warped_gyro_deck\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Instrument Deck Cabinet\",\n      \"flavour\": \"An upright grey cabinet with a blue screen, rows of coloured indicator strips and a vent grid, red and blue cables spilling out the bottom and a yellow rod jutting off the top.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"solid\", \"medium\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"cracked_ablative_nose_cone\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Cracked Nose Cone Shell\",\n      \"flavour\": \"A tapering grey shell with a raised rib running down the spine and a jagged broken edge where the rest of it stayed behind. Already half gone, so handle the half you have.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"fragile\", \"medium\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"split_avionics_rack\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Green Avionics Card\",\n      \"flavour\": \"One green board, two fat black chips, a red can and a row of gold contact fingers along the bottom edge, with a mounting tab still sticking out the side. Snaps like a biscuit.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"fragile\", \"medium\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"torn_reactor_shield_plate\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Torn Board Fragment\",\n      \"flavour\": \"A jagged green shard with two yellow stripes and a couple of components clinging on, one splinter drifting free and a rust-brown wire curling underneath. Top-shelf scrap, and it pays like it.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"high\", \"valuable\", \"medium\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"cracked_deep_space_dish\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Dented Deep Space Dish\",\n      \"flavour\": \"A grey dish on a blocky mount, feed arm on struts crossing its face, rim gone irregular where something folded it. Thin skin, high price, and it dents if you look at it wrong.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"high\", \"fragile\", \"valuable\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"fused_ion_grid_assembly\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Emptied Grid Frame\",\n      \"flavour\": \"A square navy frame with nothing left inside it but pale cyan shards angling in from the corners and a hollow middle. What is left is edges, so tether it gently.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"high\", \"fragile\", \"small\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"severed_boom_mast\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Severed Cable Run\",\n      \"flavour\": \"A braided strand running long and twisted, frayed open into a bristly knot where it was cut. Bulky in the hold and it pays the top-shelf rate for every kilo of it.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"high\", \"valuable\", \"oversized\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"scorched_fuel_cell_stack\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Cell Tray Assembly\",\n      \"flavour\": \"A grey open case partitioned into compartments of blocky cells, yellow, red and orange bars still marking charge on each one. Dense, tidy, and worth the climb.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"high\", \"valuable\", \"solid\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"shattered_cryo_dewar\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Stencilled H2O Tank\",\n      \"flavour\": \"A bright cyan tank on its side, stub fittings at both ends, one nozzle up top and H2O stencilled black across the belly. Somebody's drinking water, worth a fortune this high up.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"high\", \"fragile\", \"valuable\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"impact_pitted_engine_bell\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Sooted Engine Bell\",\n      \"flavour\": \"A flared cone standing on ring ridges, throat black with soot and the base rim crusted rust-brown. Dense enough that the tether goes taut before you have finished pulling.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"high\", \"heavy\", \"solid\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"cracked_command_module_hatch\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Six-Sided Fastener Ring\",\n      \"flavour\": \"One small hex ring, face-on, hole through the middle, a highlight on the upper corner and nothing else in the cell. Absurd that a nut from up here outsells a panel from down low.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"high\", \"fragile\", \"small\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"armstrongs_module\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Armstrong's Module\",\n      \"flavour\": \"A grey canister lying diagonal, rimmed at both ends, two yellow bands around its body, one end dented and a chip broken off beside it. Apollo-era, older than the cascade, and it takes the whole tank to bring home.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"heavy\", \"high\", \"valuable\", \"small\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\", \"5d\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"notes\": [\n    \"Both sheets opened and read. Six cells contradict their ids outright and were written from the picture: torn_foil_blanket is a fractured grey hull slab with no foil in it; burst_pressurant_sphere is a cluster of pitted slag with no vessel; ruptured_helium_tank is quilted soft goods strapped into a roll; torn_reactor_shield_plate is a broken circuit-board fragment; shattered_cryo_dewar carries H2O stencilled on it, which beats the id outright; cracked_command_module_hatch is a plain hex nut.\",\n    \"Several ids name damage the artist did not draw (cracked_battery_pallet, delaminated_radiator_fin, cracked_optics_barrel, warped_gyro_deck, split_avionics_rack, scorched_fuel_cell_stack all read intact). Where the table still flags the piece fragile I earned the claim on thinness or glass rather than on damage that is not on screen.\",\n    \"cracked_command_module_hatch is flagged fragile but is drawn as a solid hex nut; I carried the fragile claim on the table's authority and kept the flavour from calling it sturdy.\"\n  ]\n}","ttft_ms":1574,"ttft_stream_ms":1058,"time_to_request_ms":257,"type":"result","duration_ms":62960,"uuid":"cee06e3d-6990-4728-8795-74e154b3a528"}
